                                                                        vpiDecompile: "\"DRC Error : Simulation halted due Corrupted DIP. To correct this problem, make sure that reliable data is fed to the DIP. The correct Parity must be generated by a Hamming code encoder or encoder in the Block RAM. The output from the model is unreliable if there are more than 2 bit errors. The model doesn't warn if there is sporadic input of more than 2 bit errors due to the limitation in Hamming code.\""
